        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to regional sales and service staff, we maintain a group of global personnel focused on coordinating sales projects and obtaining design specifications for complex projects involving multiple customers within the manufacturing supply chain.",
